{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20782","headline":"寄萧二十三庆中 · 卢仝","name":"寄萧二十三庆中","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"萧乎萧乎，忆萧者嵩山之卢。\n卢扬州，萧歙州。\n相思过春花，鬓毛生麦秋。\n千灾万怪天南道，猩猩鹦鹉皆人言。\n山魈吹火虫入椀，鸩鸟咒诅鲛吐涎。\n就中南瘴欺北客，凭君数磨犀角吃。\n我忆君心千百间，千百间君何时还，使我夜夜劳魂魄。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢仝","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20782.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20782","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}